{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55584","headline":"游南雁荡 · 钱弘儇","name":"游南雁荡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年曾作雁山期，今日来看似故知。\n好鸟隔林歌侑酒，飞花绕笔索题诗。\n云霞眼底原无物，丘壑胸中似有奇。\n萝月松风清似水，何妨游衍咏归迟。\n（见周喟《南雁荡山志》卷七引陈玭《嘉靖南雁山志》、郑思恭《崇祯南雁山志》。\n此诗承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱弘儇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}